# The day's routines as lines (docs/DIALOGUE.md, "The bitten, the clock and what you carry"): shift
# change at 05:30 and 17:30, supper at 18:30, the night watch at 20:30. No clocks of their own: the
# game hour opens and closes them. And the epilogue week, said in passing.

conv bark.named.bastion.shiftchange
for named:bastion, post:bastion
when hour>=17 & hour<18
bark
voice bastion

node start
  say? hour>=17 & hour<18 :: Evening shift change at half five. The roster's on the board by the door if you're looking for a name.
  say Shift change. Relief is on its way in, and that's the only relief anyone here still expects.

conv bark.occupant.supper
for occupant
when hour>=18 & hour<19 & !house:died
bark
voice haven

node start
  say? house:short :: Supper's thin tonight. Sit anyway: grace first, then you can argue about the potatoes.
  say Sit, it's grace. Half six in every house, and nobody starts before the youngest. You can eat standing up afterwards, like the rest of us.

conv bark.named.bastion.watch
for named:bastion, post:bastion
when hour>=20 & hour<22
bark
voice bastion

node start
  say Night watch from half eight, and the roll after it. Lights down. If you're staying inside the wire tonight, you're on the roster.

conv bark.occupant.epilogue
for occupant
when epilogue
bark
voice haven

node start
  say? cure_held:everyone :: Somebody brought the cure to the door in a crate with no name on it, and didn't stop for soup. Who doesn't stop for soup?
  say? cure_held:bastion :: We're all on Bastion's register now, every name in the house. Everyone's on a list. It's almost restful, being counted.
  say Processing at the checkpoints, the loudspeakers say. Nobody from this house has gone up the road yet.

conv bark.named.redhand.epilogue
for named:redhand
when epilogue
bark
voice redhand

node start
  say? cure_held:redhand :: Prices on the board, cure in the crate, a queue round the lorry. Best week this road has ever had.
  say Cure's out, and the toll's still a tin. Some things in the Zone are sacred.

conv bark.named.halcyon.epilogue
for named:halcyon
when epilogue
bark
voice halcyon

node start
  say The batch is out and the results are in. The writing-up takes longer than the work did. It always has.
